IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `psga-directions`

-- Public Sector (Governance) Act 2018, Parts 1 and 2 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law.
-- Nothing here has been checked against a decided case.
--
-- The sixteen-field direction fixtures are generated from a table of overrides to a
-- common default (given by the Minister, on recommendation, requiring a Government
-- policy, on data governance, no purpose, nothing impeded), so that a typing slip cannot
-- make a case say something other than its name.

§ `Fixtures -- the sixteen-field directions`

`a sound direction on data governance for efficiency` MEANS DirectionFacts WITH
    `given by the Minister, or jointly` IS TRUE
    `on the recommendation of the relevant Minister, where there is one` IS TRUE
    `requires compliance with a policy of the Government` IS TRUE
    `the subject matter` IS `data governance and sharing of information between agencies`
    `to uphold and promote the values of the Singapore public sector` IS FALSE
    `to secure economies or efficiencies` IS TRUE
    `to improve the efficiency or effectiveness of policies, programme management or service planning and delivery` IS FALSE
    `to ensure business continuity` IS FALSE
